==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*2 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Baki Hanma (Enemy)|Baki Hanma]] spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**2 [[Mooth]]s spawn, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

